WEBVTT

1
00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:45.038
♪ I'M GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

2
00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.840
♪ GONNA HAVE MYSELF
A TIME ♪

3
00:01:46.842 --> 00:01:48.408
♪ FRIENDLY FACES
EVERYWHERE ♪

4
00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.243
♪ HUMBLE FOLKS
WITHOUT TEMPTATION ♪

5
00:01:50.245 --> 00:01:51.544
♪ GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

6
00:01:51.546 --> 00:01:53.580
♪ GONNA LEAVE
MY WOE'S BEHIND ♪

7
00:01:53.582 --> 00:01:55.048
♪ AMPLE PARKING
DAY OR NIGHT ♪

8
00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.883
♪ PEOPLE SHOUTING
"HOWDY NEIGHBOR" ♪

9
00:01:56.885 --> 00:01:58.318
♪ HEADED ON
UP TO SOUTH PARK ♪

10
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.620
♪ GONNA SEE IF
I CAN'T UNWIND ♪

11
00:02:00.622 --> 00:02:02.856
( mumbling )

12
00:02:03.492 --> 00:02:04.991
♪ SO COME ON DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

13
00:02:04.993 --> 00:02:07.227
♪ AND MEET SOME
FRIENDS OF MINE ♪

14
00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:10.130
HEY STAN, WHERE'D YOU
GET THAT BLACK EYE?

15
00:02:10.132 --> 00:02:12.031
NOTHING,
I MEAN<i> NOWHERE.</i>

16
00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.234
YOUR SISTER
BEAT YOU UP AGAIN?

17
00:02:14.236 --> 00:02:14.801
NO!

18
00:02:14.803 --> 00:02:17.103
YOUR SISTER
KICKED YOUR ASS!

19
00:02:17.105 --> 00:02:19.739
SHE'S PISSED OFF 'CAUSE SHE GOT
HEADGEAR AT THE DENTIST.

20
00:02:19.741 --> 00:02:20.773
SHE'S TAKING IT
OUT ON<i> ME.</i>

21
00:02:20.775 --> 00:02:23.510
BUT THAT SUCKS YOU GET YOUR
BUTT KICKED BY A GIRL, STAN.

22
00:02:23.512 --> 00:02:25.979
I WOULD NEVER
LET A WOMAN KICK MY ASS.

23
00:02:25.981 --> 00:02:28.047
IF SHE TRIED ANYTHING,
I'D BE LIKE,

24
00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:31.217
"YOU GET YOUR BITCH-ASS
BACK IN THE KITCHEN

25
00:02:31.219 --> 00:02:32.652
AND MAKE ME
SOME PIE!"

26
00:02:32.654 --> 00:02:34.621
MY PARENTS DON'T EVEN BELIEVE
THAT SHE BEATS ME UP.

27
00:02:34.623 --> 00:02:36.656
THEY THINK SHE'S ALL
INNOCENT AND SWEET.

28
00:02:36.658 --> 00:02:38.258
BUT I KNOW THAT
SHE'S AN EVIL BITCH.

29
00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.094
BE A MAN, STAN,
JUST SAY, "HEY WOMAN

30
00:02:41.096 --> 00:02:44.230
YOU SHUT YOUR MOUTH
AND MAKE BABIES!"

31
00:02:44.232 --> 00:02:47.200
HEY KYLE, WHAT'S THAT
ELEPHANT DOING?

32
00:02:47.202 --> 00:02:48.168
YOU MEAN
THIS ONE?

33
00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:49.636
HE'S MY NEW
PET ELEPHANT.

34
00:02:49.638 --> 00:02:51.871
WHERE'D YOU GET
A PET ELEPHANT?

35
00:02:51.873 --> 00:02:53.439
I GOT IT MAIL ORDER
FROM AFRICA.

36
00:02:53.441 --> 00:02:55.542
THE AD SAID IT WOULD
TAKE FOUR TO SIX WEEKS,

37
00:02:55.544 --> 00:02:57.043
BUT IT ONLY
TOOK THREE!

38
00:02:57.045 --> 00:02:58.178
WOW,
THAT'S COOL!

39
00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:58.912
NO, IT'S NOT COOL!

40
00:02:58.914 --> 00:03:00.613
MY MOM WON'T LET ME
KEEP HIM IN THE HOUSE!

41
00:03:00.615 --> 00:03:01.447
SHE SAYS
HE'S TOO BIG

42
00:03:01.449 --> 00:03:03.049
AND THAT HIS POOP
IS BIGGER THAN OUR COUCH.

43
00:03:03.051 --> 00:03:05.585
THAT'S WHY MY MOM GOT ME
A POT-BELLIED PIG,

44
00:03:05.587 --> 00:03:07.754
'CAUSE ITS
POOP IS<i> SMALL.</i>

45
00:03:07.756 --> 00:03:09.556
( mumbling )

46
00:03:09.558 --> 00:03:13.092
YEAH, BUT PIGS AREN'T
SMART LIKE ELEPHANTS.

47
00:03:14.129 --> 00:03:14.627
HEY!

48
00:03:14.629 --> 00:03:17.664
WAIT A MINUTE,
WHAT IS<i> THAT</i> THING?!

49
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:21.201
THIS IS THE NEW
RETARDED KID.

50
00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:23.836
OH, I'M SORRY
LITTLE GIRL.

51
00:03:23.838 --> 00:03:25.939
BUT YOU STILL
CAN'T GET ON!

52
00:03:25.941 --> 00:03:29.475
YOU HAVE TO TAKE
THE SPECIAL-ED BUS!

53
00:03:29.477 --> 00:03:30.977
DUH!
DUH!

54
00:03:30.979 --> 00:03:33.813
LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE NOT
WELCOME ANYWHERE, ELEPHANT.

55
00:03:33.815 --> 00:03:34.948
SEE YA!

56
00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.150
IF A WOMAN
GAVE ME CRAP,

57
00:03:37.152 --> 00:03:40.119
I'D SAY,
"YOU GO DO MY LAUNDRY!"

58
00:03:40.121 --> 00:03:42.021
SIT DOWN, KID!

59
00:03:42.023 --> 00:03:43.223
YES, MA'AM.

60
00:03:43.225 --> 00:03:45.592
AND NOW CHILDREN,
OUR FRIEND MR. HAT,

61
00:03:45.594 --> 00:03:49.195
IS GOING TO TELL US ALL ABOUT
GENETIC ENGINEERING.

62
00:03:49.197 --> 00:03:50.663
THAT'S RIGHT,
MR. GARRISON.

63
00:03:50.665 --> 00:03:54.033
GENETIC ENGINEERING IS
AN EXCITING NEW SCIENCE.

64
00:03:54.035 --> 00:03:56.903
YOU CAN SPLICE THE DNA
FROM SOME ANIMALS

65
00:03:56.905 --> 00:03:58.571
AND MAKE
THEM BETTER.

66
00:03:58.573 --> 00:03:59.606
MR. GARRISON?

67
00:03:59.608 --> 00:04:00.406
YES, KYLE.

68
00:04:00.408 --> 00:04:01.541
WITH GENETIC
ENGINEERING,

69
00:04:01.543 --> 00:04:03.042
CAN YOU MAKE
AN ELEPHANT SMALLER?

70
00:04:03.044 --> 00:04:05.945
WELL, YES,
I SUPPOSE YOU COULD.

71
00:04:05.947 --> 00:04:09.415
YOU COULD SPLICE ELEPHANT GENES
WITH A DOG OR CAT

72
00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:11.317
OR POT-BELLIED PIG GENES.

73
00:04:11.319 --> 00:04:11.884
THAT'S IT!

74
00:04:11.886 --> 00:04:14.187
I'M GONNA COMBINE MY ELEPHANT
WITH A POT-BELLIED PIG

75
00:04:14.189 --> 00:04:15.588
AND MAKE POT-BELLIED
ELEPHANTS.

76
00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:18.024
THEY'D BE SMART
LIKE ELEPHANTS,

77
00:04:18.026 --> 00:04:19.492
BUT SMALL LIKE PIGS.

78
00:04:19.494 --> 00:04:20.460
THAT'D BE COOL!

79
00:04:20.462 --> 00:04:21.527
I'D WANT A
POT-BELLIED ELEPHANT.

80
00:04:21.529 --> 00:04:23.663
YES, I'LL PAY
$50 FOR ONE.

81
00:04:23.665 --> 00:04:24.831
THAT'S STUPID.

82
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:25.365
SHUT UP!

83
00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:27.367
WE COULD GENETICAL ENGINEER
ANYTHING WE WANT.

84
00:04:27.369 --> 00:04:29.636
I BET I COULD CLONE
A HUMAN BEING

85
00:04:29.638 --> 00:04:32.472
BEFORE YOU CROSSBREED
AN ELEPHANT AND A PIG.

86
00:04:32.474 --> 00:04:33.606
I'LL BET
YOU CAN'T!

87
00:04:33.608 --> 00:04:34.440
WATCH ME,
PLEBEIAN.

88
00:04:34.442 --> 00:04:36.743
WELL, SPANK MY ASS
AND CALL ME CHARLIE.

89
00:04:36.745 --> 00:04:37.944
ISN'T THIS EXCITING?

90
00:04:37.946 --> 00:04:40.079
TWO "A+" STUDENTS
IN A CLONING WAR.

91
00:04:40.081 --> 00:04:41.147
YES, MR. GARRISON.

92
00:04:41.149 --> 00:04:43.082
GENETIC ENGINEERING
LET'S US CORRECT

93
00:04:43.084 --> 00:04:45.184
GOD'S HORRIBLE,
HORRIBLE MISTAKES,

94
00:04:45.186 --> 00:04:45.952
LIKE GERMAN PEOPLE.

95
00:04:45.954 --> 00:04:48.888
YOU BOYS MIGHT WANNA VISIT
THE GENETIC ENGINEERING RANCH

96
00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.024
OUTSIDE OF TOWN
FOR SOME HELP.

97
00:04:51.026 --> 00:04:52.158
AND YOU COULD
BOTH USE THIS

98
00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.328
FOR YOUR SCIENCE FAIR
PROJECTS NEXT MONTH.

99
00:04:56.598 --> 00:04:58.298
GENETIC
ENGINEERING RANCH?

100
00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:58.765
SWEET!

101
00:04:58.767 --> 00:05:00.099
WAIT, WAIT,
WE STILL NEED A PIG.

102
00:05:00.101 --> 00:05:01.267
WE COULD USE
CARTMAN'S PIGS.

103
00:05:01.269 --> 00:05:03.503
YOU LEAVE FLUFFY
OUT OF THIS!

104
00:05:03.505 --> 00:05:04.637
WE'RE NOT GONNA
HURT HER.

105
00:05:04.639 --> 00:05:05.672
WE JUST NEED
SOME OF HER BLOOD.

106
00:05:05.674 --> 00:05:07.640
YOU'RE NOT USING
ANY OF FLUFFY'S BLOOD!

107
00:05:07.642 --> 00:05:09.542
I'LL KICK YOU
IN THE NUTS!

108
00:05:09.544 --> 00:05:11.044
KYLE, KYLE, NO!

109
00:05:11.046 --> 00:05:13.646
STANLEY, CAN I TALK TO YOU
FOR A MINUTE?

110
00:05:13.648 --> 00:05:14.047
OKAY.

111
00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:15.915
I COULDN'T HELP NOTICE
THAT BLACK EYE.

112
00:05:15.917 --> 00:05:18.484
ARE THERE
PROBLEMS AT HOME?

113
00:05:18.486 --> 00:05:19.686
YES.

114
00:05:19.688 --> 00:05:20.720
OH, DEAR.

115
00:05:20.722 --> 00:05:22.789
HERE STANLEY,
SIT DOWN,

116
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:23.623
HAVE SOME COCOA,

117
00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:25.992
AND TELL YOUR FRIEND
MR. HAT ALL ABOUT IT.

118
00:05:25.994 --> 00:05:27.927
I'M YOUR FRIEND,
MR. HAT, STAN,

119
00:05:27.929 --> 00:05:29.929
YOU CAN
TELL ME ANYTHING.

120
00:05:29.931 --> 00:05:31.364
NOW WHO HIT YOU?

121
00:05:31.366 --> 00:05:33.666
IS IT YOUR FATHER
OR YOUR MOTHER?

122
00:05:33.668 --> 00:05:36.002
NEITHER,
IT'S MY SISTER.

123
00:05:36.004 --> 00:05:36.803
YOUR SISTER?!

124
00:05:36.805 --> 00:05:38.571
OH FOR PETE'S SAKE,
DON'T BE SUCH A LITTLE WUS!

125
00:05:38.573 --> 00:05:42.308
STOP WASTING MR. HAT'S TIME
WITH PANSY LITTLE FU-FU PROBLEMS

126
00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.911
AND GIVE ME BACK
MY COCOA!

127
00:05:52.387 --> 00:05:54.020
HEY!

128
00:05:56.791 --> 00:05:57.357
HI, SHELLY.

129
00:05:57.359 --> 00:05:58.825
ARE YOU LOOKING
AT MY HEADGEAR?

130
00:05:58.827 --> 00:06:00.126
HEADGEAR,
WHAT HEADGEAR?

131
00:06:00.128 --> 00:06:01.861
ARE YOU LOOKING
AT MY HEADGEAR?!

132
00:06:01.863 --> 00:06:04.163
GOSH, I DIDN'T
REALLY NOTICE.

133
00:06:04.165 --> 00:06:05.531
YOU LITTLE LIAR!

134
00:06:05.533 --> 00:06:07.567
NO, I THINK
IT LOOKS TERRIFIC!

135
00:06:07.569 --> 00:06:09.802
IT MATCHES YOUR--
AAH...!

136
00:06:11.373 --> 00:06:13.339
AAH...!

137
00:06:24.886 --> 00:06:26.419
READY TO GO,
STAN?

138
00:06:26.421 --> 00:06:26.953
GO WHERE?

139
00:06:26.955 --> 00:06:28.654
TO THE GENETICAL
ENGINEERING RANCH.

140
00:06:28.656 --> 00:06:29.489
WE GOT
CARTMAN'S PIG,

141
00:06:29.491 --> 00:06:31.190
SO WE CAN SPLICE ITS GENES
WITH MY ELEPHANT.

142
00:06:31.192 --> 00:06:33.426
NOBODY'S SPLICING
NOTHING FROM FLUFFY!

143
00:06:33.428 --> 00:06:36.295
( Shelly )
I SWEAR I'M GONNA
KILL YOU, STAN!

144
00:06:36.297 --> 00:06:37.897
WHY IS YOUR SISTER
SO MEAN TO YOU, DUDE?

145
00:06:37.899 --> 00:06:40.967
YEAH, IF SOME SISSY CHICK
TRIED TO KICK MY ASS,

146
00:06:40.969 --> 00:06:43.970
I BE LIKE,
HEY, LISTEN MISSY,

147
00:06:43.972 --> 00:06:46.506
WHY DON'T YOU GO
KNIT ME A SWEATER

148
00:06:46.508 --> 00:06:48.741
BEFORE I SLAP YOU
IN THE FACE?!

149
00:06:48.743 --> 00:06:50.576
WHO SAID THAT?

150
00:06:56.484 --> 00:06:57.417
THIS MUST BE IT.

151
00:06:57.419 --> 00:06:59.519
LOOKS LIKE
NOBODY'S HOME.

152
00:06:59.521 --> 00:07:01.554
GUESS WE SHOULD COME BACK
SOME OTHER TIME.

153
00:07:01.556 --> 00:07:02.989
NO, CARTMAN,
WE'RE GOING IN THERE

154
00:07:02.991 --> 00:07:04.690
AND SPLICING FLUFFY
AND MY ELEPHANT TOGETHER.

155
00:07:04.692 --> 00:07:07.560
IT'S OKAY, FLUFFY,
I WON'T LET THEM HURT YOU.

156
00:07:07.562 --> 00:07:08.961
IT'S JUST
A STUPID PIG.

157
00:07:08.963 --> 00:07:09.796
QUIT BEING
SUCH A BABY.

158
00:07:09.798 --> 00:07:12.999
WELL AT LEAST I DON'T GET
MY ASS KICKED BY A GIRL!

159
00:07:13.001 --> 00:07:14.534
AT LEAST I'M NOT
A LITTLE PIG--

160
00:07:14.536 --> 00:07:17.970
I'M TAKING MY PIG,
AND SCREW YOU GUYS!

161
00:07:17.972 --> 00:07:18.805
I'M GOING HOME!

162
00:07:18.807 --> 00:07:20.406
THIS WHOLE IDEA
IS STUPID ANYWAY!

163
00:07:20.408 --> 00:07:22.809
WHAT THE HELL WOULD YOU KNOW?
YOU FAT SWEATY MONGOLOID.

164
00:07:22.811 --> 00:07:24.377
YOU NEVER GET
HIGHER THAN A "D"!

165
00:07:24.379 --> 00:07:26.612
WHY DON'T YOU GO BACK
TO SAN FRANCISCO

166
00:07:26.614 --> 00:07:27.914
WITH THE REST
OF THE JEWS!

167
00:07:27.916 --> 00:07:31.017
THERE'S NO JEWS IN
SAN FRANCISCO YOU RETARD!

168
00:07:31.019 --> 00:07:33.886
I'LL KICK YOU
IN THE NUTS!

169
00:07:33.888 --> 00:07:35.922
CAN I HELP YOU?

170
00:07:38.193 --> 00:07:39.192
UH, YEAH.

171
00:07:39.194 --> 00:07:41.561
WE WANNA CROSSBREED
AN ELEPHANT WITH A PIG.

172
00:07:41.563 --> 00:07:42.962
BRILLIANT IDEA.

173
00:07:42.964 --> 00:07:44.464
HUGE ELEPHANT-SIZED PIGS.

174
00:07:44.466 --> 00:07:47.033
NO, WE WANNA MAKE LITTLE
POT-BELLIED ELEPHANTS

175
00:07:47.035 --> 00:07:49.101
THAT PEOPLE CAN KEEP
IN THEIR HOUSES AS PETS.

176
00:07:49.103 --> 00:07:51.270
THAT'S AN EVEN
BETTER IDEA.

177
00:07:51.272 --> 00:07:52.104
COME ON IN.

178
00:07:52.106 --> 00:07:54.841
I'M SO PLEASED THAT
YOU CHILDREN ARE INTERESTED

179
00:07:54.843 --> 00:07:55.942
IN GENETIC ENGINEERING.

180
00:07:55.944 --> 00:07:58.744
IT'S OKAY, FLUFFY,
NOBODY'S GONNA HURT YOU.

181
00:07:58.746 --> 00:08:01.214
IT'S THANKS TO THE WONDERS
OF GENETIC ENGINEERING

182
00:08:01.216 --> 00:08:03.449
THAT SOON THERE WILL BE
AN END TO HUNGER,

183
00:08:03.451 --> 00:08:06.052
DISEASE, POLLUTION,
EVEN WAR.

184
00:08:06.054 --> 00:08:07.153
I'VE CREATED THINGS

185
00:08:07.155 --> 00:08:09.388
THAT WILL CHANGE
THE WORLD FOR THE BETTER.

186
00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:10.356
FOR INSTANCE,

187
00:08:10.358 --> 00:08:12.959
HERE'S A MONKEY
WITH FOUR ASSES.

188
00:08:13.728 --> 00:08:14.961
HOW DOES THAT
MAKE THE WORLD BETTER?

189
00:08:14.963 --> 00:08:17.897
AND HERE OF COURSE,
IS MY FOUR-ASSED OSTRICH,

190
00:08:17.899 --> 00:08:19.365
AND MY FOUR-ASSED
MONGOOSE.

191
00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:22.268
DO YOU HAVE ANYTHING BESIDES
ANIMALS WITH FOUR ASSES?

192
00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.537
OH, WELL,
I SUPPOSE SO.

193
00:08:24.539 --> 00:08:26.172
OH, YES,
OVER HERE.

194
00:08:26.174 --> 00:08:28.774
HERE I HAVE RATS
SPLICED WITH DUCKS.

195
00:08:28.776 --> 00:08:30.810
AND GORILLAS SPLICED
WITH MOSQUITOES.

196
00:08:30.812 --> 00:08:33.913
AND HERE I HAVE RABBITS
SPLICED WITH FISH

197
00:08:33.915 --> 00:08:35.147
TO MAKE
LITTLE BUNNY FISH.

198
00:08:35.149 --> 00:08:38.217
THESE BUNNY EARS ARE TIED ON
WITH LITTLE STRINGS!

199
00:08:38.219 --> 00:08:41.888
AND OVER HERE SWISS CHEESE
SPLICED WITH CHALK

200
00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:42.788
AND A BEARD.

201
00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.257
WHAT ABOUT OUR
POT-BELLIED ELEPHANT?

202
00:08:44.259 --> 00:08:46.425
OH, WELL,
I'M SORRY, CHILDREN.

203
00:08:46.427 --> 00:08:49.562
BUT PIG AND ELEPHANT DNA
JUST WON'T SPLICE.

204
00:08:49.564 --> 00:08:52.398
HAVEN'T YOU HEARD
THAT SONG BY LOVERBOY?

205
00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.232
WHICH SONG
IS THAT?

206
00:08:53.234 --> 00:08:57.637
♪ PIG AND ELEPHANT DNA
JUST WON'T SPLICE ♪

207
00:08:57.639 --> 00:09:00.806
MAYBE I CAN HELP YOU
ADD A FEW ASSES
TO THAT SWINE OF YOURS.

208
00:09:00.808 --> 00:09:03.509
YOU CAN KEEP YOUR HANDS OFF
OF<i> FLUFFY'S</i> ASS!

209
00:09:03.511 --> 00:09:05.211
IT'S AMAZING
WHAT WE CAN DO

210
00:09:05.213 --> 00:09:07.613
WITH A LITTLE
BLOOD SAMPLE THESE DAYS.

211
00:09:07.615 --> 00:09:08.981
OW!

212
00:09:08.983 --> 00:09:10.049
WHAT?
EXCUSE ME.

213
00:09:10.051 --> 00:09:12.118
WAIT, WHAT ARE YOU TAKING
STAN'S BLOOD FOR?

214
00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.753
OH, PARDON ME,
I TRIPPED.

215
00:09:13.755 --> 00:09:15.087
COULD I HAVE SOME
HAIR, PLEASE?

216
00:09:15.089 --> 00:09:17.423
WATCH OUT, STAN,
GENETIC ENGINEERS ARE CRAZY!

217
00:09:17.425 --> 00:09:19.892
C'MON, FLUFFY!

218
00:09:22.897 --> 00:09:25.298
THIS QUICHE IS JUST
??

219
00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.499
THAT'S
PRETTY FRESH.

220
00:09:26.501 --> 00:09:28.768
OH, I SURE AM
HUNGRY.

221
00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:29.468
'ELLO, GENTLEMEN.

222
00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:32.104
ANY OF YOU BLOKES
KNOW WHAT'S FOR LUNCH?

223
00:09:33.641 --> 00:09:35.675
LUNCHY MUNCHIES, HMM?

224
00:09:35.677 --> 00:09:37.543
GO AWAY, PIP,
NOBODY LIKES YOU!

225
00:09:37.545 --> 00:09:39.445
YEAH, WHAT KIND OF NAME
IS "PIP" ANYWAY?

226
00:09:39.447 --> 00:09:41.581
MY FATHER'S FAMILY NAME
BEING "PHILLIP"

227
00:09:41.583 --> 00:09:43.449
AND MY CHRISTIAN NAME
"PHILLIP"--

228
00:09:43.451 --> 00:09:45.551
WOULD YOU
SHUT THE HELL UP?!

229
00:09:45.553 --> 00:09:47.286
NOBODY GIVES
A RAT'S ASS!

230
00:09:47.288 --> 00:09:48.654
YEAH,
GO AWAY PIP.

231
00:09:48.656 --> 00:09:50.089
RIGHT-O.

232
00:09:50.625 --> 00:09:52.525
FRENCH PEOPLE
PISS ME OFF.

233
00:09:52.527 --> 00:09:53.326
HEY, DUMB ASSES!

234
00:09:53.328 --> 00:09:56.295
YOU MORONS GIVE UP ON YOUR
STUPID SCIENCE FAIR PROJECT?

235
00:09:56.297 --> 00:09:58.164
NO, WE'RE ALREADY
HALFWAY DONE.

236
00:09:58.166 --> 00:10:01.634
THEN ALL<i> YOU'VE</i> GOT
IS A STUPID PIG.

237
00:10:01.636 --> 00:10:04.136
PROBABLY
A GAY PIG, TOO.

238
00:10:04.138 --> 00:10:05.638
IT'S MORE THAN
<i>YOU'VE</i> GOT!

239
00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:06.205
WRONG!

240
00:10:06.207 --> 00:10:09.275
WE ALREADY GOT
OUR CLONE UNDER WAY.

241
00:10:09.711 --> 00:10:11.978
OH, MY GOD,
THEY CLONED A FOOT!

242
00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:15.114
HEY, I'LL
KICK YOUR ASS!

243
00:10:16.551 --> 00:10:19.051
BY FRIDAY WE'RE GONNA CLONE
A WHOLE HUMAN BEING.

244
00:10:19.053 --> 00:10:21.454
GOOD LUCK WITH YOUR
STUPID LITTLE PIG.

245
00:10:21.456 --> 00:10:22.722
HELLO THERE,
CHILDREN.

246
00:10:22.724 --> 00:10:23.255
HEY, CHEF.

247
00:10:23.257 --> 00:10:24.490
HOW YOU DOING?

248
00:10:24.492 --> 00:10:25.291
BAD.
BAD.

249
00:10:25.293 --> 00:10:25.891
WHY?

250
00:10:25.893 --> 00:10:28.060
WE NEED TO GENETICALLY ENGINEER
A PIG AND AN ELEPHANT,

251
00:10:28.062 --> 00:10:29.228
BUT THEIR GENES
WON'T SPLICE.

252
00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.397
OF COURSE THEY
WON'T SPLICE, CHILDREN.

253
00:10:31.399 --> 00:10:34.233
HAVEN'T YOU EVER HEARD
THAT SONG BY LOVERBOY?

254
00:10:34.235 --> 00:10:38.237
♪ PIG AND AN ELEPHANT DNA
JUST WON'T-- ♪

255
00:10:38.239 --> 00:10:39.138
A PIG-ELEPHANT?

256
00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.742
SAY, THAT'S NOT
A BAD IDEA.

257
00:10:42.744 --> 00:10:43.676
I TOLD YOU GUYS.

258
00:10:43.678 --> 00:10:46.112
IMAGINE A PINT-SIZED
ELEPHANT

259
00:10:46.114 --> 00:10:47.947
THAT YOU COULD
KEEP IN THE HOUSE.

260
00:10:47.949 --> 00:10:51.117
CHILDREN, WE COULD MAKE
A<i> FORTUNE</i> WITH THIS.

261
00:10:51.119 --> 00:10:52.818
YOU HEAR THAT, DUDES?
WE'LL BE RICH!

262
00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:55.621
FORGET ABOUT ALL THAT
GENETIC ENGINEERING<i> HOOSAFUDGE.</i>

263
00:10:55.623 --> 00:10:58.090
IF YOU WANT TO COMBINE
A PIG AND AN ELEPHANT

264
00:10:58.092 --> 00:11:01.093
JUST GET THEM
TO MAKE SWEET LOVE.

265
00:11:01.095 --> 00:11:04.030
I DON'T THINK AN ELEPHANT
WOULD MAKE LOVE TO A PIG.

266
00:11:04.032 --> 00:11:04.997
I DON'T THINK
MY PIG

267
00:11:04.999 --> 00:11:07.533
WOULD WANNA MAKE LOVE
TO THAT STUPID ELEPHANT!

268
00:11:07.535 --> 00:11:08.367
SURE,
THEY WOULD.

269
00:11:08.369 --> 00:11:10.503
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE TO
GET 'EM IN THE MOOD.

270
00:11:10.505 --> 00:11:11.771
HOW DO WE
DO THAT?

271
00:11:11.773 --> 00:11:15.007
DO WHAT I DO,
GET 'EM GOOD AND DRUNK.

272
00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.376
YOU GUYS WANNA COME OVER
TO MY HOUSE?

273
00:11:17.378 --> 00:11:18.277
WE GOT WORK
TO DO, STAN.

274
00:11:18.279 --> 00:11:20.146
I THINK IT TAKES A WHILE
FOR AN ELEPHANT TO GET DRUNK.

275
00:11:20.148 --> 00:11:22.782
YOU DON'T WANNA COME OVER
FOR A LITTLE BIT?

276
00:11:22.784 --> 00:11:25.384
WHY, YOUR SISTER GONNA
KICK YOUR ASS AGAIN?

277
00:11:25.386 --> 00:11:26.652
SHUT UP,
CARTMAN!

278
00:11:26.654 --> 00:11:27.553
( mumbling )

279
00:11:27.555 --> 00:11:29.188
YEAH, STAN,
SHE'S JUST A<i> GIRL.</i>

280
00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.857
YEAH, IF SOME GIRL
TRIED TO KICK MY ASS

281
00:11:31.859 --> 00:11:33.025
I'D BE LIKE, HEY!

282
00:11:33.027 --> 00:11:36.462
WHY DON'T YOU STOP
DRESSING ME UP LIKE A MAILMAN

283
00:11:36.464 --> 00:11:38.330
AND MAKING ME
DANCE FOR YOU

284
00:11:38.332 --> 00:11:40.833
WHILE YOU GO AND SMOKE CRACK
IN YOUR BEDROOM

285
00:11:40.835 --> 00:11:43.969
AND HAVE SEX WITH SOME GUY
I DON'T EVEN KNOW

286
00:11:43.971 --> 00:11:45.938
ON MY DAD'S BED?!

287
00:11:48.342 --> 00:11:50.576
CARTMAN, WHAT THE HELL
ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?!

288
00:11:50.578 --> 00:11:53.145
I'M JUST SAYING YOU'RE
A LITTLE WUS, THAT'S ALL.

289
00:11:53.147 --> 00:11:56.515
STAN, YOU CAN USE FAMILY LOVE
AS A WEAPON AGAINST SHELLY.

290
00:11:56.517 --> 00:11:57.783
THE NEXT TIME SHE'S GONNA
KICK YOUR ASS,

291
00:11:57.785 --> 00:12:00.753
JUST TELL HER,
"SHELLY, YOU'RE MY SISTER
AND I LOVE YOU."

292
00:12:00.755 --> 00:12:03.823
SICK, DUDE,
SHE'S MY SISTER!

293
00:12:03.825 --> 00:12:04.490
TRY IT.

294
00:12:04.492 --> 00:12:05.991
WE GOTTA GO
GET CARTMAN'S PIG.

295
00:12:05.993 --> 00:12:08.194
NO YOU DON'T GOTTA GET
CARTMAN'S PIG!

296
00:12:08.196 --> 00:12:09.895
YOU LEAVE FLUFFY
OUT OF THIS!

297
00:12:09.897 --> 00:12:10.796
C'MON, KENNY!

298
00:12:10.798 --> 00:12:11.497
KYLE, NO!

299
00:12:11.499 --> 00:12:13.999
NO ELEPHANT IS GONNA
MAKE LOVE TO FLUFFY!

300
00:12:14.001 --> 00:12:17.269
I WILL KICK YOU
IN THE NUTS!

301
00:12:17.705 --> 00:12:19.171
CRAP!

302
00:12:19.173 --> 00:12:21.874
( television )
And now back to
Jesus and pals...

303
00:12:21.876 --> 00:12:24.643
ARE YOU STARING
AT MY NECK BRACE?

304
00:12:24.645 --> 00:12:25.978
NO, I MEAN YES?

305
00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.147
I MEAN,
WHAT NECK BRACE?

306
00:12:28.483 --> 00:12:31.751
SHELLY, BEFORE YOU BEAT MY FACE
INTO A BLOODY PULP AGAIN,

307
00:12:31.753 --> 00:12:33.119
I JUST WANT YOU
TO KNOW

308
00:12:33.121 --> 00:12:36.122
THAT YOU'RE MY SISTER
AND I LOVE YOU.

309
00:12:39.093 --> 00:12:40.126
OW!

310
00:12:40.128 --> 00:12:42.595
SOMEDAY I'M GONNA
BE BIGGER THAN YOU

311
00:12:42.597 --> 00:12:45.798
AND YOU'RE GONNA WISH YOU'D
NEVER DONE ANY OF THIS.

312
00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:49.602
YOU'LL NEVER BE BIGGER
THAN ME, STAN.

313
00:12:49.604 --> 00:12:51.537
NEVER!

314
00:12:51.939 --> 00:12:55.007
BEAUTIFUL,
IT'S ABSOLUTELY BEAUTIFUL.

315
00:12:55.009 --> 00:12:58.144
MY SON, I THINK
WE'VE FINALLY DONE IT.

316
00:12:58.146 --> 00:12:59.478
YES, WE HAVE, DAD.

317
00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.647
MY VERY OWN
HUMAN CLONE.

318
00:13:01.649 --> 00:13:03.582
HOPE IT'S NOT
A GAY CLONE.

319
00:13:03.584 --> 00:13:05.351
YEAH.

320
00:13:05.353 --> 00:13:06.685
THIS SHOW'S
STUPID.

321
00:13:06.687 --> 00:13:08.053
C'MON, ELEPHANT,
KEEP DRINKING.

322
00:13:08.055 --> 00:13:09.755
I WONDER HOW DRUNK
HE NEEDS TO BE

323
00:13:09.757 --> 00:13:12.691
TO MAKE SWEET LOVE
TO THE PIG.

324
00:13:15.329 --> 00:13:17.263
DAMNIT, THIS IS
NEVER GONNA WORK!

325
00:13:17.265 --> 00:13:18.264
HELLO, CHILDREN.

326
00:13:18.266 --> 00:13:19.198
I THOUGHT
I'D CHECK AND SEE

327
00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:23.068
HOW OUR LITTLE ENTREPRENEURIAL
ADVENTURE IS GOING.

328
00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:23.569
ROTTEN!

329
00:13:23.571 --> 00:13:25.704
THEY'RE BOTH DRUNK
BUT WON'T HAVE SEX!

330
00:13:25.706 --> 00:13:26.705
OH, CHILDREN,

331
00:13:26.707 --> 00:13:29.708
YOU CAN'T STICK A DRUNK PIG
WITH A DRUNK ELEPHANT

332
00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:33.112
AND EXPECT THEM
TO DO THE MATTRESS MAMBO.

333
00:13:33.114 --> 00:13:34.446
YOU NEED TO
SET THE MOOD.

334
00:13:34.448 --> 00:13:37.750
LET ME SHOW YOU BOYS
WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT.

335
00:13:38.319 --> 00:13:40.719
♪ TONIGHT IS RIGHT
FOR LOVE ♪

336
00:13:40.721 --> 00:13:45.357
♪ YOU KNOW I WANNA TOUCH YOU
WHERE THE LIGHTS DON'T GO ♪

337
00:13:45.359 --> 00:13:48.894
♪ TONIGHT IS
RIGHT FOR LOVE ♪

338
00:13:48.896 --> 00:13:50.963
♪ LOVE GRAVY ♪

339
00:13:53.467 --> 00:13:55.534
♪ MAKE SPECIAL LOVE
SO SWEET ♪

340
00:13:55.536 --> 00:14:00.039
♪ I WANNA KEEP YOU BURNING
LIKE A DOG IN HEAT ♪

341
00:14:00.041 --> 00:14:02.908
♪ TONIGHT IS
RIGHT FOR LOVE ♪

342
00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.444
♪ LOVE GRAVY ♪

343
00:14:07.114 --> 00:14:09.915
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
MR. ELTON JOHN!

344
00:14:09.917 --> 00:14:13.319
♪ OOH, TONIGHT ♪

345
00:14:13.321 --> 00:14:16.555
♪ OH, IT'S RIGHT ♪

346
00:14:16.557 --> 00:14:20.092
♪ OOH, TONIGHT
IS RIGHT FOR LOVE ♪

347
00:14:20.094 --> 00:14:22.194
♪ LOVE GRAVY ♪

348
00:14:23.664 --> 00:14:24.897
THANK YOU, ELTON!

349
00:14:24.899 --> 00:14:27.700
♪ TONIGHT IS
RIGHT FOR LOVE ♪

350
00:14:27.702 --> 00:14:30.703
♪ LOVE GRAVY ♪

351
00:14:32.473 --> 00:14:34.807
HEY LOOK,
IT'S WORKING!

352
00:14:35.276 --> 00:14:35.908
NOW CHILDREN,

353
00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:40.079
GATHER AROUND AND WATCH
THE WONDERS OF LIFE.

354
00:14:40.081 --> 00:14:43.249
THE BEAUTY
OF MOTHER NATURE.

355
00:14:44.452 --> 00:14:46.352
OH, SICK!

356
00:14:46.354 --> 00:14:47.786
FLUFFY!

357
00:14:47.955 --> 00:14:52.324
NOW I KNOW HOW ALL THOSE
WHITE WOMEN MUST'VE FELT.

358
00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.463
OUR CREATURE
HAS COME TO FRUITION.

359
00:14:57.465 --> 00:14:59.832
DAD, YOU'RE
THE<i> BEST.</i>

360
00:14:59.834 --> 00:15:00.866
OH, MY GOD!

361
00:15:00.868 --> 00:15:01.934
HE ONLY
HAS ONE ASS!

362
00:15:01.936 --> 00:15:05.204
HE'S OF NO USE TO ME,
I'LL HAVE TO BURN THE ROOM!

363
00:15:06.574 --> 00:15:07.606
OH, NO.

364
00:15:07.608 --> 00:15:11.143
THIS ENTIRE EXPERIMENT
IS TURNING OUT VERY BAD.

365
00:15:11.145 --> 00:15:12.912
ME BAD?

366
00:15:14.582 --> 00:15:16.782
<i>EGATS,</i> HE'S
OUT OF CONTROL.

367
00:15:16.784 --> 00:15:17.917
WE'LL HAVE
TO DESTROY HIM!

368
00:15:17.919 --> 00:15:20.119
BUT HE'S OUR
SCIENCE FAIR PROJECT!

369
00:15:20.121 --> 00:15:23.055
( jibberish )

370
00:15:23.057 --> 00:15:24.356
HE'S TOO
DANGEROUS, SON.

371
00:15:24.358 --> 00:15:27.526
BUT, DAD,
I WANT A HUMAN CLONE!

372
00:15:27.528 --> 00:15:29.061
SON, NO!

373
00:15:31.732 --> 00:15:34.199
SON, YOU'VE MADE
A HORRIBLE MISTAKE.

374
00:15:34.201 --> 00:15:37.102
YOU'VE PUT ALL THE PEOPLE
OF SOUTH PARK IN JEOPARDY!

375
00:15:37.104 --> 00:15:38.837
THEY'RE ALL
STUPID ANYWAY.

376
00:15:38.839 --> 00:15:40.773
C'MON, GUYS,
LET'S GO.

377
00:15:40.775 --> 00:15:43.008
THEY'RE ALL GAY.

378
00:15:43.444 --> 00:15:45.411
AREN'T THEY EVER
GONNA WAKE UP?

379
00:15:45.413 --> 00:15:46.545
OH, THEY WILL.

380
00:15:46.547 --> 00:15:48.747
IT'S GONNA BE
ONE UGLY SIGHT.

381
00:15:48.749 --> 00:15:50.983
I THOUGHT YOU SAID
THE WONDER OF MOTHER NATURE

382
00:15:50.985 --> 00:15:51.750
WAS A
BEAUTIFUL THING.

383
00:15:51.752 --> 00:15:54.086
WHEN DOES MOTHER NATURE
GO FROM BEAUTIFUL TO UGLY?

384
00:15:54.088 --> 00:15:57.756
USUALLY ABOUT 9:30
IN THE MORNING, CHILDREN.

385
00:15:58.893 --> 00:16:01.193
UH-OH,
HERE WE GO.

386
00:16:04.465 --> 00:16:07.132
THERE'S NOTHING WORSE THAN
GETTING ALL DRUNK

387
00:16:07.134 --> 00:16:10.135
AND WAKING UP THE NEXT MORNING
NEXT TO A PIG!

388
00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:13.572
OR A BIG FAT
ELEPHANT.

389
00:16:13.574 --> 00:16:15.307
HEY, HOW DO WE KNOW
IF SHE'S PREGNANT?

390
00:16:15.309 --> 00:16:18.577
WE MIGHT NOT KNOW
FOR A COUPLE OF DAYS.

391
00:16:18.579 --> 00:16:19.278
COUPLE OF DAYS?

392
00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:22.381
BUT TERRANCE IS GOING TO HAVE
HIS HUMAN CLONE BY TOMORROW.

393
00:16:22.383 --> 00:16:23.449
GOOD JOB,
EINSTEIN!

394
00:16:23.451 --> 00:16:25.551
WHY DON'T WE JUST BUILD
A ROCKET IN THE MEANTIME?

395
00:16:25.553 --> 00:16:27.252
THANK BUDDHA
I FOUND YOU BOYS.

396
00:16:27.254 --> 00:16:30.155
YOU MUST TELL ME, HAVE YOU
SEEN ANYTHING ODD LATELY?

397
00:16:30.157 --> 00:16:33.425
WE SAW AN ELEPHANT
HAVE SEX WITH A PIG.

398
00:16:33.427 --> 00:16:34.593
NO, I SAID<i> ODD.</i>

399
00:16:34.595 --> 00:16:37.329
YOU'RE THAT CRAZY CRACKER
FROM UP ON THE HILL.

400
00:16:37.331 --> 00:16:41.367
SIR, IF MAKING MUTANT ANIMALS
SPLICED WITH HUMANS

401
00:16:41.369 --> 00:16:43.969
IS CRAZY THAN--

402
00:16:43.971 --> 00:16:45.704
UH...

403
00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:47.740
HMM...

404
00:16:47.742 --> 00:16:48.807
NEVERMIND.

405
00:16:48.809 --> 00:16:51.343
THERE'S BEEN A BIT
OF AN INCIDENT AT THE RANCH.

406
00:16:51.345 --> 00:16:53.979
YOU SEE, I'VE CREATED
A LARGE MUTANT CLONE

407
00:16:53.981 --> 00:16:55.581
OF THAT
LITTLE BOY THERE

408
00:16:55.583 --> 00:16:57.182
AND HE'S BROKEN FREE.

409
00:16:57.184 --> 00:16:59.018
( mumbling )

410
00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:00.519
A BIG MUTANT
VERSION OF<i> ME</i>?

411
00:17:00.521 --> 00:17:02.054
IS HE BIGGER
THAN A REGULAR CLONE?

412
00:17:02.056 --> 00:17:03.789
HE'S TERRIBLY
DANGEROUS.

413
00:17:03.791 --> 00:17:05.891
HIS BRAIN
IS IDENTICAL TO YOURS.

414
00:17:05.893 --> 00:17:08.227
I NEED<i> YOU</i>
TO HELP ME FIND HIM.

415
00:17:08.229 --> 00:17:10.763
( crowd screaming )

416
00:17:12.233 --> 00:17:15.768
STAN, ARE YOU WEARING
A DIFFERENT HAT?

417
00:17:17.271 --> 00:17:17.770
HEY!

418
00:17:17.772 --> 00:17:21.907
I KNOW A CERTAIN YOUNG MAN
WHO'S ITCHING FOR DETENTION!

419
00:17:24.612 --> 00:17:26.078
HOW BIG DO YOU
THINK HE IS?

420
00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.079
I BET HE WEIGHS
400 POUNDS!

421
00:17:27.081 --> 00:17:30.149
C'MON, STAN, DON'T YOU EVEN KNOW
WHERE YOU WOULD GO?

422
00:17:30.151 --> 00:17:32.684
OH, MY GOD!

423
00:17:33.821 --> 00:17:36.422
It appears that the horrible
destructive creature

424
00:17:36.424 --> 00:17:39.525
is actually eight-year-old
Stan Marsh of South Park.

425
00:17:39.527 --> 00:17:43.362
When asked why he was wreaking
such havoc on his hometown

426
00:17:43.364 --> 00:17:47.166
The little boy replied simply,
"Me Stan...

427
00:17:47.168 --> 00:17:49.301
( jibberish )

428
00:17:49.303 --> 00:17:50.869
Back to you
in the studio.

429
00:17:50.871 --> 00:17:52.504
THANKS, TOM,
POLICE ARE REQUESTING

430
00:17:52.506 --> 00:17:54.206
THAT IF YOU SEE THIS
LITTLE 8-YEAR-OLD BOY

431
00:17:54.208 --> 00:17:56.542
YOU IMMEDIATELY KILL HIM
AND BURN HIS BODY.

432
00:17:56.544 --> 00:17:57.342
THAT'S ALL FOR NOW.

433
00:17:57.344 --> 00:17:59.411
AND NOW BACK TO
"JESUS AND PALS".

434
00:17:59.413 --> 00:18:03.515
THE WAY IS PAVED WITH GOLD
FOR YE WHO SEEK TRUTH.

435
00:18:04.318 --> 00:18:06.752
( jibberish )

436
00:18:06.754 --> 00:18:08.487
JESUS!

437
00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.991
OFFICER, MY EVIL GENETIC CLONE
IS DESTROYING THE TOWN!

438
00:18:12.993 --> 00:18:13.826
WE HAVE
TO FIND HIM!

439
00:18:13.828 --> 00:18:16.695
YOU BOYS HAVE BEEN WATCHING
"THE X-FILES" TOO MUCH.

440
00:18:16.697 --> 00:18:19.398
THERE'S NO SUCH THING
AS GENETIC CLONE--!

441
00:18:20.901 --> 00:18:23.335
( gargled speech )

442
00:18:24.538 --> 00:18:26.305
C'MON,
LET'S GO!

443
00:18:26.307 --> 00:18:27.072
THERE YOU ARE!

444
00:18:27.074 --> 00:18:29.908
STANLEY, YOU TORE UP
MY ENTIRE GUN SHOP!

445
00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:31.944
YOU BETTER HAVE
A GOOD EXPLANATION FOR THIS!

446
00:18:31.946 --> 00:18:35.414
IT WASN'T ME UNCLE JIMBO,
IT WAS MY EVIL GENETIC CLONE.

447
00:18:35.416 --> 00:18:37.983
STANLEY, WHAT THE HELL
HAS GOTTEN INTO YOU?!

448
00:18:37.985 --> 00:18:40.385
YOU HAVE GOT SEVERE
LUNCHROOM DUTY, MISTER!

449
00:18:40.387 --> 00:18:43.255
I'M GONNA GO HAVE A WORD
WITH YOUR FATHER, STANLEY!

450
00:18:43.257 --> 00:18:46.258
YOU WAIT 'TILL YOUR FATHER
HEARS ABOUT THIS.

451
00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:48.293
WAIT, STAN,
THERE HE GOES.

452
00:18:48.996 --> 00:18:50.596
STOP!

453
00:18:50.965 --> 00:18:52.631
( jibberish )

454
00:18:52.633 --> 00:18:54.099
HE RECOGNIZES YOU, DUDE.

455
00:18:54.101 --> 00:18:56.168
THAT'S GOOD,
THAT'S GOOD, DUDE.

456
00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.569
JUST CALM DOWN.

457
00:18:57.571 --> 00:18:59.771
( jibberish )

458
00:19:01.242 --> 00:19:03.408
WHAT SHOULD
WE DO WITH HIM?

459
00:19:03.611 --> 00:19:06.411
STAN, HOW WOULD YOU
LIKE TO GO HOME

460
00:19:06.413 --> 00:19:08.647
AND MEET
YOUR SISTER?

461
00:19:11.752 --> 00:19:14.820
SHELLY'S THE ONE WITH THE
BIG WIRE COMING OUT OF HER MOUTH

462
00:19:14.822 --> 00:19:16.221
AND A METAL PLATE
ON HER BACK.

463
00:19:16.223 --> 00:19:18.056
WHEN YOU SEE SHELLY,
KICK HER ASS.

464
00:19:18.058 --> 00:19:20.159
SHELLY BAD!
SHELLY VERY BAD!

465
00:19:20.161 --> 00:19:21.326
ME BAD?

466
00:19:21.328 --> 00:19:23.729
NO, SHELLY BAD,
YOU GOOD.

467
00:19:26.934 --> 00:19:29.902
HE'S TEARING UP THE HOUSE,
STOP HIM!

468
00:19:38.913 --> 00:19:41.980
WHAT THE HELL
DO<i> YOU</i> WANT?

469
00:19:43.384 --> 00:19:45.851
( jibberish )

470
00:19:47.154 --> 00:19:50.355
BOYS, BOYS, I'M LUSCIOUSLY
SORRY FOR EVERYTHING.

471
00:19:50.357 --> 00:19:53.625
HEY, THEY GOT OUR CLONE,
HE BELONGS TO<i> US.</i>

472
00:19:53.627 --> 00:19:54.092
NO, SON,

473
00:19:54.094 --> 00:19:56.595
THIS BEAST IS A DISGRACE
TO GENETIC ENGINEERS.

474
00:19:56.597 --> 00:20:00.599
BOYS, I'M SORRY I'VE CAUSED YOU
SUCH INCONVENIENCE.

475
00:20:00.601 --> 00:20:03.635
I TRIED TO PLAY GOD
AND I FAILED.

476
00:20:04.505 --> 00:20:06.605
DADDY, NO...!

477
00:20:06.607 --> 00:20:07.339
ALL I EVER WANTED

478
00:20:07.341 --> 00:20:10.342
WAS TO GENETICALLY ENGINEER
SOMETHING USEFUL,

479
00:20:10.344 --> 00:20:11.176
BUT I FAILED.

480
00:20:11.178 --> 00:20:13.812
PERHAPS WE SHOULDN'T BE TOYING
WITH GOD'S CREATIONS.

481
00:20:13.814 --> 00:20:16.281
PERHAPS WE SHOULD JUST
LEAVE NATURE ALONE

482
00:20:16.283 --> 00:20:18.750
TO ITS SIMPLE
ONE-ASSED SCHEMATICS.

483
00:20:18.752 --> 00:20:21.286
YOU CHEATING BASTARDS,
THIS ISN'T OVER!

484
00:20:21.288 --> 00:20:23.822
JUST WAIT
UNTIL TOMORROW!

485
00:20:24.058 --> 00:20:26.458
OH, MY GOD,
THEY KILLED KENNY!

486
00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:27.726
YOU BASTARD!

487
00:20:27.728 --> 00:20:30.929
MOM AND DAD ARE HOME.
MY HOUSE IS A DISASTER!

488
00:20:30.931 --> 00:20:32.097
YOU GUYS
GOTTA HELP ME.

489
00:20:32.099 --> 00:20:34.833
I AIN'T HELPING CRAP.
I WANNA EAT SOME PIE.

490
00:20:34.835 --> 00:20:36.735
YOU CAN'T JUST
LEAVE ME HERE ALONE!

491
00:20:36.737 --> 00:20:37.736
OH, YEAH?
WATCH ME.

492
00:20:37.738 --> 00:20:40.872
WE HAVE TO FIND OUT IF CARTMAN'S
PIG IS PREGNANT OR NOT.

493
00:20:40.874 --> 00:20:42.774
THANKS A LOT!

494
00:20:42.776 --> 00:20:46.812
OH, BOY, YOU ARE
GONNA GET IT<i> NOW.</i>

495
00:20:48.182 --> 00:20:49.514
IT ISN'T FAIR!

496
00:20:49.516 --> 00:20:50.549
EVERYBODY HATES ME!

497
00:20:50.551 --> 00:20:52.117
THE WHOLE TOWN
WANTS ME KILLED!

498
00:20:52.119 --> 00:20:54.553
MOM AND DAD ARE GONNA
SEND ME AWAY!

499
00:20:54.555 --> 00:20:59.057
I DON'T WANNA BE SENT AWAY,
I WANNA STAY HERE!

500
00:21:00.527 --> 00:21:03.462
STANLEY, WHAT IN GOD'S NAME
HAVE YOU BEEN DOING?!

501
00:21:03.464 --> 00:21:06.131
EVERYBODY IN TOWN IS
UPSET WITH YOU, YOUNG MAN.

502
00:21:06.133 --> 00:21:09.001
WHAT'S GOING ON?
ARE YOU ON DRUGS?

503
00:21:09.003 --> 00:21:12.237
IT'S NOT
STAN'S FAULT.

504
00:21:12.239 --> 00:21:13.038
HUH?

505
00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.306
IT WASN'T STAN.

506
00:21:14.308 --> 00:21:15.474
HE WAS...

507
00:21:15.476 --> 00:21:17.976
HE WAS WITH ME
THE WHOLE TIME.

508
00:21:17.978 --> 00:21:18.844
OH.

509
00:21:18.846 --> 00:21:22.180
WELL STAN, WE'RE SORRY
WE JUMPED TO CONCLUSIONS.

510
00:21:22.182 --> 00:21:25.617
OH, HONEY,
PLEASE FORGIVE US, SON.

511
00:21:27.988 --> 00:21:29.554
SHELLY,
YOU SAVED MY LIFE.

512
00:21:29.556 --> 00:21:32.324
AND YET YOU'VE DONE
SO MUCH MORE THAN THAT.

513
00:21:32.326 --> 00:21:34.559
TODAY YOU'VE TAUGHT ME
THE MEANING OF FAMILY.

514
00:21:34.561 --> 00:21:36.428
SURE, FAMILIES
DON'T ALWAYS GET ALONG

515
00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:38.497
BUT WHEN THE FORCES OF EVIL
DESCEND UPON US

516
00:21:38.499 --> 00:21:41.199
WE CONQUER THEM
BY STICKING TOGETHER.

517
00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:57.149
OKAY, KYLE,

518
00:21:57.151 --> 00:21:59.151
WE'RE READY TO SEE
YOUR SCIENCE PROJECT.

519
00:21:59.153 --> 00:22:01.219
WELL, OUR PIG HASN'T
GIVEN BIRTH YET,

520
00:22:01.221 --> 00:22:02.621
BUT SHE SHOULD
ANY TIME NOW.

521
00:22:02.623 --> 00:22:04.156
OH, WELL, THEN I GUESS
YOU GET AN "F".

522
00:22:04.158 --> 00:22:06.591
OKAY, TERRANCE, I KNOW
THE CLASS CAN HARDLY WAIT

523
00:22:06.593 --> 00:22:08.560
TO SEE<i> YOUR</i>
SCIENCE FAIR PROJECT.

524
00:22:08.562 --> 00:22:09.728
THANK YOU,
MR. GARRISON.

525
00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:12.497
BOYS, MR. GARRISON,
FELLOW STUDENTS,

526
00:22:12.499 --> 00:22:13.932
FOR OUR
SCIENCE FAIR PROJECT,

527
00:22:13.934 --> 00:22:15.934
BILL FOSSEY AND I
HAVE SPAWNED A CREATURE

528
00:22:15.936 --> 00:22:17.903
GENETICALLY
FAR SUPERIOR TO MAN.

529
00:22:17.905 --> 00:22:19.438
I PRESENT TO YOU...

530
00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:21.673
THE FIVE-ASSED
MONKEY.

531
00:22:21.675 --> 00:22:25.010
OH, MR. HAT,
ISN'T IT BEAUTIFUL?

532
00:22:27.314 --> 00:22:29.981
WAIT, WAIT,
THE PIG JUST GAVE BIRTH!

533
00:22:29.983 --> 00:22:30.982
IT HAD A BABY!

534
00:22:30.984 --> 00:22:33.018
( kid )
WHAT'S IT
LOOK LIKE?

535
00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:35.821
DOES IT LOOK LIKE A PIG,
OR AN ELEPHANT?

536
00:22:39.893 --> 00:22:42.694
HEY, IT KINDA LOOKS
LIKE MR. GARRISON.

537
00:22:42.696 --> 00:22:45.931
OH, GEE, ISN'T THAT
AN AMAZING COINCIDENCE?

538
00:22:45.933 --> 00:22:48.533
WHAT ARE
THE ODDS OF<i> THAT</i>?

539
00:22:48.535 --> 00:22:49.868
HMM...

540
00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.270
YOU BOYS
GET FIRST PRIZE.

541
00:22:55.342 --> 00:22:57.542
THAT'LL DO, PIG.

542
